# Test: everyday words earn no squiggle (dictionary top-1000 delta).
# Regression: "sat" was missing from en_basic.txt, so "The cat
# sat." showed a spell squiggle under "sat." in the Grammar
# screenshot; "preview" / "table" / "view" / "tools" were missing
# too. "normal" / "neighbor" (Batch 6 fix round) were missing
# as well: squiggles in the Normal-view / Borders screenshots.
